<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Mast says involved in negotiations.</title>
<headline>Mast says involved in negotiations.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Education and training group Mast Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday it was in talks which could have an impact on its share price and urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>It gave no further details in a brief announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
